    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yelemia kwinhwa wiyaabī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mhayo gūkang'wizīīla ū Yelemia kūfuma kūlī SEEBA; yalī hanuma ya ng'wa Nebuzaladani ū ntaale wa balang'hani ba h'ikūlū kūnsanga ū Yelemia alī Lama, ūng'winha wiyaabī. Akampandīkīla henaho atungilwe nhendele hamò na a batungwa a bangī, a ba kūfuma Yelusalemu na Yuda; pye a bose baalī bahelelilwe lūgendo lwa kūtwalwa Babuloni bakikale ko mu būding'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa balang'hani ba ntemi aho wampandīka ū Yelemia, ūng'wīla, “Ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we walī alīhelelile a mayanga genaya ī lipandī lyenīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha ū SEEBA washikīlījaga, wītaga gīt'ūmo walī wahayīla gīkī akwīta. Pyī ī yenīyī yajile gīko kūlwa nguno a bing'we ng'wang'wītīla shibi ū SEEBA; kūlwa kūlema kūng'wigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī lelo yenīyī nalīkūtungūla nakwīngīje ī nhendele ījo ūtungilwe mu makono gako. Tūjage bose ī Babuloni ūlū ūlībona īlībeelela, nakūjūkūlang'hana; alīyo ūlū ūtūtogagwa, ndūhū ū mhayo, lekaga ū kwiza. Ūlīyībona ī sī yīyī īlī kū būtongi wako, jaga hose hose ūko ūlatogwe kūja bebe ng'wenekele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yelemia aho ataalī kūgalūka aje,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūgalūka aje:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, aho ataalī kūshosha mhayo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ū Nebuzaladani ongeja, “Ī gete shokaga ūje kūlī Gedalia, ng'wana Ahikamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shafani, ūyo ntemi wa Babuloni wansolile abize nsugi wayo ī mizengo ya mu Yuda. Jaga ko ūkikale nang'hwe ū mu banhū abo balīko, nūūlū ūje hose hose ūko ūlatogwe kūja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yelemia ūja Misipa h'ūko walī ū Gedalia ng'wana Ahikamu, ūūkikala nang'hwe ū mu banhū abo baalī basaagīīla ū mu sī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedalia nsugi wa sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale na a banhū babo abo baalī bataalī kū matogolo bakigwa, gīkī ū ntemi wa Babuloni wantūūlile Gedalia ng'wana Ahikamu, kūbiza nsugi wa sī; ūnsola na kūbiza ntaale wabo pye a bagosha na a bakīma na a baana, abo baalī batatwalilwe Babuloni kū būding'wa; abo baalī bakuuneese ba bakuuneese ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bataale benabo būbūūka kūja ī Misipa, ū kūlī Gedalia. Baalīmo, Ishimaeli ng'wana Nesania, na Yohanani na Yonasani bitūnja ba ng'wa Kalea; na Selaya ng'wana Tanhumeti, na bitūnja ba ng'wa Efai muna Netofa, na Yazania ng'witūnja wa muna Maaka; baalī hamò na banhū babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gedalia ng'wana Ahikamu, ng'wizūkūlū Shafani akilahīla kū būtongi wabo hamò na a banhū babo, ūbawīla, “Yaya ū kogoha ū kūbatūmamīla a Bakalidayo, ikalagi dūhū ū mu sī yenīyī muntūmamīle ū ntemi wa Babuloni; īkūgololoka ī mihayo ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakwikala ī Misipa, nayūhooya nabo a Bakalidayo ūlū biza ū mu sī yise; a bing'we bene ikalagi dūhū ū mu mizengo ying'we īyo ng'wīdimile, muje nago ū nīmo gwa kūbilinga ī divai nī shisuumo sha mu makanza ga chū, pye na a maguta; shose shenīshi ng'ūshibīka mu shiseme shing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a Bayudaya abo baalī Moabu, Amoni, Edomu nū ū mu sī ī jingī pyī ī jose, aho bigwa gīkī ū ntemi wa Babuloni walekeelile būshiigo wa banhū ū mu sī ya Yuda, ūnsola Gedalia ng'wana Ahikamu ng'wizūkūlū Shafani kūbiza nsugi wabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pye bakashoka mu sī ya Yuda, kwīngīīla hose hose ū kū sī ījo baalī bapeelela, būja ī Misipa ū kūlī Gedalia. Nabo būyūbilinga ī divai nī shisuumo sha mu shikū ja chū, nīyo bakakwīja no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yohanani ng'wana Kalea, na a bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale abo baalī kū matogolo būshika ī Misipa ū kūlī Gedalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biza būng'wīla, “Bebe ūtamanile gīkī ū ntemi wa Baamoni ū Baalisi, wantūmile Ishimaeli, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Netania kwiza kūkūbūlaga?” Alīyo ū Gedalia ng'wana Ahikamu atagūzunije ū mhayo gwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Yohanani ng'wana Kalea aho alī Misipa, akang'wīla mhayo ū Gedalia balī babīlī dūhū; ūhaya, “Nizunīlījage naje nakamūlage ū Ishimaeli ū ng'wana Netania; atīho munhū ose ose wa kūgūdeeba ū mhayo gwenūyū. Nibūlī akūbūlage, abenheleje kūsalang'hana pye a Bayudaya abo bizile aha kūkwibilingīla, na a banhū abo basaagīīlile mu Yuda bayagaale? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Gedalia ng'wana Ahikamu ūng'wīla ū Yohanani ng'wana Kalea, ‘Yaya lekaga ū kwīta mhayo gūlī gīko, īyo ūlīng'haya ū Ishimaeli ītī ya ng'hana.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
